# Population z-drift for the zvariation_popshift fixture: peak drifts on
# SALT2c (0.2*z, exactly linear) and SALT2x1 (piecewise), width drift on
# SALT2c (both sigmas +0.1*z), AV exponential tau drift (+1.6*z) and a
# gray magnitude offset (0.3*z). All entries use z-bin rows; the in-file
# polynomial form is dead in SNANA (FLAG never set, init aborts with
# Invalid FLAG=-9). A leading bin below the generation range is required
# (SNANA aborts when z falls at/below the second bin). This file is read
# token-by-token with NO comment handling in SNANA, so comments must
# avoid the literal key words.
PARAMETER: GENPEAK_SALT2c
ZBIN: -0.01  0.0
ZBIN:  0.00  0.0
ZBIN:  0.50  0.1

PARAMETER: GENSIGMA[0]_SALT2c
ZBIN: -0.01  0.0
ZBIN:  0.00  0.0
ZBIN:  0.50  0.05

PARAMETER: GENSIGMA[1]_SALT2c
ZBIN: -0.01  0.0
ZBIN:  0.00  0.0
ZBIN:  0.50  0.05

PARAMETER: GENPEAK_SALT2x1
ZBIN: -0.01  0.0
ZBIN:  0.00  0.0
ZBIN:  0.20  0.5
ZBIN:  0.50  1.0

PARAMETER: GENTAU_AV
ZBIN: -0.01  0.0
ZBIN:  0.00  0.0
ZBIN:  0.50  0.8

PARAMETER: GENMAG_OFF_GLOBAL
ZBIN: -0.01  0.0
ZBIN:  0.00  0.0
ZBIN:  0.50  0.15
END:
